{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>And these are the names of the chiefs of Esau, by their families, by their places.</b> These latter ones became the primary ones to be enumerated as chiefs of city after city, as it is written: 'by their families, in the land of their possession.' And a proof for the matter: in Chronicles he does not mention at all the chiefs of the first section, only the chiefs of the second section. <b>Shleima sidda, parashat Vayishlaḥ.</b>"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {0 "The Aramaic colophon 'שלימא סדרא פרשת וישלח' marks the completion of the weekly reading Vayishlaḥ (Gen. 32:4–36:43); rendered as a title."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:36.100487891Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}